 starts with you understanding that you  have an important role to play in making  the world a better place and adding  value to people's lives and then you  believe it in something so much and you  could take action every single day to  move forward on your goal you need to  get some momentum back in your life so  think about what you love doing think  about what you're passionate about think  about how you can help people and think  of how you can translate that into your  life right now  whether it's working for somebody else  or creating your own business you need  to have something that brings you hope  that gets you believing again and that  gets you excited again and number three  is create a supportive environment  chances are your garment sucks right now  everything from the people in your life  to the magazines your reading the TV  shows that you're watching everything  around you is keeping you in place it's  those people and things in your  environment that got you where you are  in the first place instead of living a  life by accident and being reactionary  to the things in your environment you  want to be proactive in creating a  supportive environment that builds you  up so start with our routine what do you  start with your day with to help add  some belief to your life to get you  excited to go out and start  accomplishing your goals and then  eliminate all the people and things in  your life that just tear you down  they'll keep you thinking small  they keep you thinking that you can't  accomplish what you set up to accomplish  and instead replace them with people  with things with videos with books that  build you up that make you believe that  give you confidence that make you want  to get out there and start doing things  I know it's tough being in the hole and  feeling like there's no way out and  feeling like you have more value to give  to the world than what is currently  happening right now to you I know that  we've all been there every single person  that you've talked to has been in that  situation where they feeling down on  themselves where they're down on their  luck and they don't know how to bust out  of it just remember that often people's  biggest successes come after they've hit  rock bottom they get monumental goals  and achieve great things after hitting  literally the bottom of the barrel so if  you do those three things of not looking  for a quick fix  finding something to believe in and then  creating a supportive environment you  too could be on your way to breaking out  of your hard times I hope that helped  answer your question thank you for  sharing and I hope you're on your way  now to getting closer to where you want  to be and believe for those of you  watching I love to hear how you've  gotten out of hard times or if you're in  a hard time right now share it in the  comments below  I'd love to get a conversation going I'm  gonna join in there with you thank you  so much for watching subscribe to the  channel if you wanna see more videos  like this and I'll see you soon  even your new literally totally not  secret I look forward to them every week  they have changed my life  thank you  you
 

